            </note>
            <note corresp="#d473-f2" n="46" xml:id="d473-f2-content">
                <p>C. L. Hsia, Alternate Chinese Representative to the Security Council.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d473-f3" n="47" xml:id="d473-f3-content">
